DTSTAMP:20261125T203711Z
UID:bd44deed6e7dfdd8ee1c452b@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The event honors all Diné warriors and our military heroes fr
 om off the Nation.The Marathon course is on the main Valley Drive\, with a
  segment in the backcountry section of the park. The stunning views and ch
 allenging terrain make for a once-in-a-lifetime running experience. The Ha
 lf Marathon is completed on the Valley Drive loop road – a graded dirt r
 oad that traverses the heart of the park. The Wildcat 4-Miler is a challen
 ging route between East and West Mittens. There is a Kids Marathon program
  in the local schools\, and the students will complete a final mile on Fri
 day morning.\n\nEvent website: https://www.navajoyes.org/events/monument-v
 alley-veterans-marathon/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizon
 a.com/events/monument-valley-marathon-half-marathon
